# 文本文件统一以 LF 保存和检出，避免不同电脑（core.autocrlf 设置不同）之间出现整文件换行差异。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.wasm binary
*.traineddata binary
